# Security & Secrets

- **Never commit secrets**: `.env*`, API keys, JWTs, service credentials, `*.pem`, `.ssh/`, `.aws/`
- **Server-only secrets stay out of `src/`** — use only in backend/server code
- **Only `VITE_*` env vars are exposed to the client** — everything else stays server-side
- **Validate ALL external input with Zod** at every boundary: forms, URL params, route loaders, edge payloads, RPC responses
- **Never use `dangerouslySetInnerHTML`** without sanitizing via DOMPurify
- **No `eval`, `new Function()`, or dynamic `import()`** of user-controlled input
- **CORS allowlist** in edge functions — never `Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *` in production
- **No PII in logs** — redact emails, phone numbers, tokens before logging
